<title>USA: U.S. budget talks &quot;good and productive&quot; -W.House.</title>
<headline>U.S. budget talks &quot;good and productive&quot; -W.House.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-04-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Budget talks between the White House and Congress have been &quot;good and productive,&quot; White House spokesman Mike McCurry said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>Asked at his regular briefing what were the chances of a budget deal being struck before the president leaves for Mexico on Monday, McCurry replied: &quot;They are uncertain.&quot;</p>
</text>
